{'symbol': 'DD', 'date': '2022-06-01 09:25:00', 'title': 'DUPONT COMPLETES DIVESTITURE OF BIOMATERIALS BUSINESS', 'text': 'WILMINGTON, DEL. , JUNE 1, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- DUPONT (NYSE: DD) TODAY ANNOUNCED COMPLETION OF THE PREVIOUSLY-ANNOUNCED SALE OF ITS BIOMATERIALS BUSINESS UNIT, EFFECTIVE MAY 31, 2022, TO THE HUAFON GROUP FOR A PURCHASE PRICE OF APPROXIMATELY $240 MILLION.'}